OL,3,GNEWSAFlying Scotsman filmed chugging
OL,4,Athrough countryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world-famous Flying Scotsman was
OL,7,Fpictured steaming through Berkshire
OL,8,Fearlier.
OL,10,FThe legendary locomotive is taking
OL,11,Fjourneys between Newbury Racecourse and
OL,12,FDidcot Parkway stations over the
OL,13,Fweekend and was spotted by fans who had
OL,14,Fgathered between Thatcham and Newbury
OL,15,FRacecourse on Saturday.
OL,17,FIt originally went into service in 1923
OL,18,Fand was given its name the following
OL,19,Fyear, after the Flying Scotsman
OL,20,Fpassenger service between London and
OL,21,FEdinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
