OL,3,GNEWSAFlying Scotsman filmed chugging
OL,4,Athrough countryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt became famous when it was featured
OL,7,Fin the British Empire Exhibition in
OL,8,F1924, then in 1934 it became the first
OL,9,Flocomotive to officially reach 100mph
OL,10,F(160.9km/h).
